{"id":10000091,"name":"娜维娅","enName":"Navia","title":"明花蔓舵","element":"岩","region":"枫丹","rarity":5,"weapon":"双手剑","birthday":"8月16日","constellation":"野蔷薇座","description":"刺玫会现任会长，一位可爱、尽责的好老板。","affiliation":"刺玫会","cv":{"chinese":"小敢","japanese":"丰崎爱生","english":"布伦娜·拉森","korean":"丁海恩"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000091-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000091-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Navia.zip","voicePackageEn":"Navia","quoteCount":74,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"大名鼎鼎的刺玫会现任会长、领导者、总指挥、话事人、老板娜维娅，很高兴认识你！看你才貌出众、气度不凡，我有种预感，我们的缘分会像我的名号一样长呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/seprbnyykc4wso477anol0ljlydz8l7.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·旅行","desc":"好想去旅游呀——！去哪无所谓啦，主要是想跟朋友们一起玩，嘿嘿。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f4/01iy1q8575pa0vviqbm4rnx6rhwb1kx.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·经验之谈","desc":"多年的帮派经验告诉我，身边有一把不称手的武器会比没有更危险。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/lhet272du2rnzhecekzbi3z663l559y.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·会标","desc":"刺玫会的标志是母亲设计的，我非常喜欢。你看，轮廓像颗心脏一样呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/369lyvqa1yeni5eseddd31ldn93ltgh.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"啊…又是雨天…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/6614h0zi33q53twv17h8pkzez378hhj.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"哎呀！刚才看到闪电就该捂住耳朵的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/1rva3vjcmdoorwwr344u6iqjd6gored.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"是不是应该摘掉帽子，让雪花落在脸上？感觉一定很清爽。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/5yo52ifpm9xucdxtn85ai2uhfmvc129.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"就是现在，立刻，马上，抬头！你看天上，是不是烈日炎炎，骄阳似火！知道这说明什么吗？\n说明我们现在应当立刻，马上，去买最大号的超级冰冰凉甜筒，然后比赛谁能在它融化前全部吃完！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/tsakngxwptv03v0hvrzs5ybeq30uk8n.mp3"},{"title":"雨过天晴…","desc":"太好了，雨停了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_afterRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/l2s9a8nwrlulp7gmarnw15ei6f3z3jy.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"帽子和裙摆…好难取舍！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/cwvsfqu2ovyppynj77do0w2wbojvz5r.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"戴上墨镜就不会被沙子迷住眼睛了！但天黑时会看不清路…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/mitokatkfm0b4xuqpene4yb281wtv8e.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上好！想好今天要做什么了吗？没想好的话，要不要跟我来？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/79zce3o7wizeoqz4g394o9wfmwavef9.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"听说最近出了一种新口味的千层面，你有没有兴趣？感觉一定不会好吃，但我还是想去试试！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/4idug00zmx3wqice4vdmldaykvp4rvg.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"晚间新闻播报：「今天的刺玫会会长也和她的好搭档度过了完美的一天。」真棒！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/06ny7mpc68c4pb3dwpjx8xyi8o5e0uo.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"快，速速清空大脑，睡个好觉！明天见。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/3t7k1einmn8rwnnwzeyqxtpz9bhagxf.mp3"},{"title":"关于娜维娅自己·乐观","desc":"盲目乐观可不行，幸福的生活要靠自己的双手去争取！所以，来，握住我的双手，左右摇晃几下——怎么样，是不是很开心？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/7i1yvlr41zllpljptk5aqn36x1m8l0y.mp3"},{"title":"关于娜维娅自己·运气","desc":"了解我经历的人可能会觉得我运气不好吧，但我不这么认为哦。\n能得到这么多的爱，是我一生最幸运的事情了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/5697q4jqrrd3y74yp56cx6ml5juinqj.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·搭档","desc":"他们有人叫我老板，有人叫我大小姐，我都无所谓啦。最开心的还是你称呼我为「搭档」的时候，所以请多叫几次，满足我的虚荣心吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/45xur4z621dim9rxl0qbt3shfhc2inv.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·保密","desc":"有人说秘密一旦说出口就不是秘密了，但能和朋友分享的秘密不是更加珍贵吗？\n…什么啊，我不是在威胁你啦！虽然身为刺玫会的会长，我当然知道很多让人保守秘密的诀窍，但我是不会用在你身上的，安心啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/oh1bi146msqei2wi9hya2n5n0gpz9ht.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"给你看，这就是我的神之眼！亮晶晶，很称我衣服的颜色吧？\n不过还是你比较厉害，不需要神之眼就能使用很多种元素，应该不是靠练习就能做到的吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/33/21q54p231f6gminldlutlbnn79n7xfp.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·狗狗","desc":"在所有的品种里，我最喜欢深栗猎犬。你看它们眼睛上方的花纹，是不是很像眉毛？所以它们总是一副憨厚又认真的样子呢。\n不过这件事还请帮我保密，千万不要告诉别的狗狗！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/j08a200wt1tsqwje9xt9z2glom85ich.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·可靠的刺玫会","desc":"假如你在灰河待过一段时间，应该会发现枫丹还是有不少其他帮派的。他们的目的不一，并不都像刺玫会那样友善，你可要多加留心。如有必要，可以向酒保泰托先生求助。若是对方不愿意坐下来谈的话…嗯，那就只好请我们可靠的白手套先生出马咯。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_share_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/bzgvowhsn38eehauz50muhlvcbmtgoo.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"久雨莲的颜色真好看啊。而且当你看到它们纷纷绽放的时候，就说明漫长的雨季终于过去了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/dbo759dr5evy2qjh5atsy9lphtn0oi0.mp3"},{"title":"关于克洛琳德…","desc":"她平时话不多，表情也不多，但还是能看出来喜怒哀乐的。之前老爹的事卡在我们之间，唔…有些隔阂吧，就算是那段日子，我也不爱她小心翼翼的样子…还是现在这样比较好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_clorinde_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/rnvwpr7shmmkdltmtbo69kxj2zueu4a.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏洛蒂…","desc":"比起跑新闻时的热情和速度，夏洛蒂的拍照技术更让我惊讶。她之前随手给我拍过一张半身照，光影效果好像精心绘制的油画一样。既能写出意想不到的报道，又能拍出最能抓人眼球的画片，她大概天生就是要做记者的吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_charlotte_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/ol1dlts8j1mn2e76eb4s7av4ogth4oy.mp3"},{"title":"关于千织…","desc":"这位为枫丹时尚带来异国风情的服装设计师，私下里帮过刺玫会不少忙呢。她说我的奇思妙想给她提供了好多创作灵感，以我对她的了解来看，应该不是客气话。但当我请她做一个十米高的礼帽时，她却严词拒绝了。唉，要是能摆在店门前，应该是很惹眼的宣传手段呀！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_chiori_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/8ni6xnzb529ay71hz9d4eni5rwfdwcr.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"小时候有幸观看过一次芙宁娜大人参与义演的歌剧，票可难买了！虽然扮演的是别的角色，但她看起来反而比平常站在高处演讲时更自然些…现在回想起来，竟然不是错觉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/1rcst2sjbpp5wva8428voy2rstc314u.mp3"},{"title":"关于那维莱特…","desc":"那维莱特先生啊，既复杂又简单。怎么说呢…就像海里的礁石，磕磕绊绊的，但假如理解了其中的规律，也不是完全没法观测。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_neuvillette_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/6907xcsqdh36alvd1116jx8knm4igcl.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱欧斯利…","desc":"想和他谈点东西可费劲了。克洛琳德说在既定的合约基础上可以放心与他合作，但千万不要相信他说的每一句话。怪不得老爹以前从不插手水下的事，保险起见，还是维持原样吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_wriothesley_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/9ujkvhbgaiet0rn968mrzbnz97wsbma.mp3"},{"title":"关于「仆人」…","desc":"她是一位威严却又慈爱的领导者，有「一家之主」的风范。不过能成为愚人众的执行官，她一定也有手段狠厉的一面。\n所以放心吧，我会永远记得她帮助过白淞镇的恩情，但在其他方面也会留心的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_arlecchino_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/5rc20ovwuugqe92ch1olj1ryym1cehr.mp3"},{"title":"关于林尼和琳妮特…","desc":"我知道大魔术师说话总会有些浮夸啦，但能看出，林尼是真心对待身边亲友的。有时候他表现出的责任感，可比他的年纪大多了…\n哦对了，他之前免费给白淞镇的小朋友们变过魔术呢！有机会的话，下次也请他和琳妮特小姐一起来吃马卡龙吧。琳妮特小姐经常凭空变出茶杯来喝茶，那应该不会讨厌甜点吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_teammate_lyney_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/40/nwr7rols4if0epldxwlzz7c3fyosd4r.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解娜维娅·其一","desc":"刺玫会的工作嘛，杂七杂八的什么都有吧，不过核心目的都是帮助大家解决各种麻烦。这里的「麻烦」只用来指代问题本身，不代表我觉得这些事情烦心哦。相反，能帮到大家会让我觉得神清气爽呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fe/j5u5kg2jn4sa5iyfpjungaw7zt6pyk7.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解娜维娅·其二","desc":"人还是要有些浪漫情怀才行。春天的花，夏天的海，还有朋友的笑容，都不该是被忽略的景色。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/hgwky7hvnzfw26xv14vrmqnbd029ctt.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解娜维娅·其三","desc":"有时我会找个人迹罕至的野外，摆一些物件作为目标，然后练习打靶。\n很解压的！你想试试吗？我来手把手教你。虽然你是我的第一个学生，但我觉得我会成为一名好老师的。老爹还有布莱卡利奶奶教我的东西我都还没忘呢！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/8qzygi3wzbbow8oqt5jmdzwvlc9qwlm.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解娜维娅·其四","desc":"我不会变成和老爹一样的人。有刺玫会里的老干部觉得我和老爹越来越像了，但我认为那只是很小的倾斜，要归因为有些问题只能用固定的几种办法来解决。刺玫会已经不是当年的样子了，那么会长也不会相同。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/fv3y3o3cd3rq47o7x12ei93z4qsnyw0.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解娜维娅·其五","desc":"我觉得我也不会变成和母亲一样的人。虽然很多人都说我性格和她很像，我也大约能想象到她当年做出很多选择的理由，但是…\n哎，突然很想去坐一次克莱门汀线。就现在，可以陪我吗？倒也没什么特别的目的，就当是我邀请你去城里闲逛吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/s1i1hiufo6pfi9r3xiat9vnrgm2fth1.mp3"},{"title":"娜维娅的爱好…","desc":"我从小就喜欢烘焙。看着一堆零散的食材按照比例融合在一起，就能在烘烤的过程中一点点膨胀、定型，变成香喷喷的样子，是不是很神奇？\n对了，有机会一起来烤姜饼吧？比比看谁能用饼干搭出最高最漂亮的小屋！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/daid9scxyaoqidag2hsvrro0y4kszod.mp3"},{"title":"娜维娅的烦恼…","desc":"呃，烤完蛋糕以后散落的面粉好难收拾啊，还有粘在容器里的蛋清和奶油…我、我去叫帮手来！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/oxtd0m88frzu3uenwytdlhl9uj3mqlc.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"我喜欢能带来惊喜的食物，但请不要怀疑我的味觉。我只是欣赏其中包含的创意，但这也不会改变很多菜品难吃的事实就是了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/andk3yynivz40ngzd5b0fhazz1fz150.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"我不喜欢存放了很久的剩菜，感觉辜负了新鲜食材的一生…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/f27odwjak9j9xhkvagfopg5t54jieze.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"惊人的厨艺！跟你出门的话，我才是应该带着食材和厨具的那个。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/9jkhgb61x3243p66l1ok78px9b8dofn.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"味道真不错，再让我加些摆盘艺术就更完美了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/96/i6c4md3pi7m2dj98tath00z7ts9hk1k.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"不要气馁，世界需要这种创新精神。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/dkdfh7b3xwv48smgtrdyhoac2ngpzsh.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"你相信许愿吗？向泉水中丢一枚摩拉，然后等待好运降临在头上。我想，只要摩拉丢得够多，其中总有一个愿望能够实现吧？\n所以与其寄希望于这样的随机事件，我决定直接用一袋摩拉为你实现今天的愿望。只要是我娜维娅力所能及的，一定都帮你办到！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/91/6fwzv3cw2hae3fg1mlyb80gsypoa31k.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"这种感觉…好像柠檬乳酪蛋糕！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cd/ll6u3m2zsgtq61nu7tw7hxrdtxc503s.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"奶油融化在舌尖，压力也跟着消散了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/g6mvlwvt8aq2kmkaxbg64i16zii07c0.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"你知道有一种子弹形状的巧克力糖吗？它的甜度能瞬间让你全身充满力量，就像我现在的感受一样！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/7yr3cw6n52g8zpwixzbima16b9kg403.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"最后再来一壶熨帖的奶茶，属于你我的茶歇时间就可以开始了。不过你为我做了这么多，用一顿茶点作为感谢还是不太够呀。以后你在枫丹要是有什么需要帮忙的，就来找刺玫会吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_navia/vo_navia_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/hvp5yf665v5j8vnzncv2kgzusz0av6v.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"小心咯！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/25/fui6fkox6til6apksc1eg40slfsztwz.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"正面偷袭！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/dw2zc14p4keapcel90z44xiel120nu1.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"你好呀！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/jqp39ih4cuwstx1nnwabufqyqqwtcoo.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"试着躲躲看？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/kjixphzg1q7xuopw7e3t2brg6zazmwd.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"猜我还有几颗子弹？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/kqb6xtcdwhkvfgc759tbq2kd1dvv1oz.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"是…伞弹枪？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/pilwiarjmfpidoredus0e2r67sed3r7.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"开火！虽然是岩元素啦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/6rj8j9vqudfgq6srvdi5pcq5x41l7ut.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"玫瑰礼花！刺玫会特别定制版。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/8gxyq3ulg2m15uwwyia2375sfm9of1d.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"持续打击！嗯嗯，就是这样。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/fw1neivugqqugry5qxax3ljjgrcu3vb.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"喔！好运连连！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/jrpjp753gr0pzvrqyqyxzvaw28v6bz4.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"快，快收好！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/nqh5rbyi7c9sp5epj5q42v2amywrwma.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"寻宝大成功！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/fmh9lrmbll0ceqhtkgghjkgraophv1r.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"再…再撑一会儿！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/83hx9kmz9l3q9m6zh1y5w5mnwh3g9ee.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"…得尽到责任！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e5/ee4czmmxwu0u4bqyoh0wr5ngx83z20v.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"注意力集中。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/ohi3pz2ifcq42tmjawydp3wndfbhr4c.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"交给会长吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/qiesjs1gn0fh6ykwbp4hq9t15qeiv12.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"增援到了！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/n3lgt23wnj0a9ev4chgxodguuwmc0l9.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"就当是…回家了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/67/8b2fkxpjq3gj1wueq6subfi94s1olsc.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"是我的错吗…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/0q8pdnlg2duap0icq0r1mfwhso5eiy0.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"就连我也…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7c/p9kdilja3x2lyq2r7t4iaiko8w6gkug.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"怎么了？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/2cowxutja4t2e9ccet2qgf8j49evfz4.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"哪来的？！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/ba/8dd4i1sny4g9mh26dv01duhzso3zlt1.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"啊…不算什么！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_navia/vo_navia_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/hvbcqvbho1ry10a4ntd26h2b8yoeblq.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"说走就走。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_navia_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/n36u56te0cib0f8wpt3i8z0zvs7nhw4.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"刺玫会出马！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_navia_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3c/cd51f6b0zc8o0ichon6udxismmw3576.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"今天我带路！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_navia_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/9ous2ca09nreg77jlvjpnqe95w1zhzr.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000091-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000091-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1274,"fullArtHeight":1018}